{
    "name": "戶外活動",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天是星期六。主角正在和哥哥聊天，<br>討論明天的行程。來看看他們要去哪裡玩吧！"
            },
            {
                "text": "Payuaw! U pilipayan anucila, a talacuwa saw kisu?",
                "textCh": "Payu，明天是星期天，你打算去哪裡？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65578/917790",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Anucila a tala lilis nu sauwac a mi’id’id tu titi kaku aci Lisin, kisu i?",
                "textCh": "我明天要和Lisin去溪邊烤肉，你呢？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65578/917791",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Ngaay namu! anu mihakulung kaku kapah tu hakiya?",
                "textCh": "聽起來很好玩！我也可以一起去嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65578/917792",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Pipalitai hen ci inaan isu!",
                "textCh": "你先問媽媽！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65578/917793",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Inaaw, kapah tu haw kaku a mihakulung ci kakaan a tala i sauwac?",
                "textCh": "媽媽，我可以跟哥哥一起去溪邊嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65578/917794",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Kapah tu! piarawi tu kamu!",
                "textCh": "可以，但你們要小心喔！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65578/917795",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-3.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Hayi, mavana’ tu kami.",
                "textCh": "沒問題，我們一定會的！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65578/917796",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            }
        ],
        "phase2": {
            "player": [
